Isolates signing: FEATURES=binpkg-signing with the pmtest test keyring
(fixtures/helpers/gpg-keyring, key 0x8812797DDF1DD192, passphrase
GentooTest).  Adds image/metadata `.sig` members to the container, signs the
Manifest (clearsigned PGP block), and lists the `.sig` files in the
Manifest.  Signature bytes and sizes are volatile (`~`/volatile=signature in
out.fields); the structure is not.  If the native writer omitted a `.sig`
member or left the Manifest unsigned, the member list / manifest.pgp-*
lines differ.  zstd only; user run only.
